 "server_rules": [
  "A code is one use: approving or using it a second time is a wrong code (409).",
  "The key is minted at handover: the poll after approval creates it, stores only its hash and returns it once. The next poll with the same token is 410.",
  "Expired requests are deleted. A poll for an expired, unknown or collected token is 410.",
  "Wrong codes count against the address and the total. While either is locked, code entry is 429 even for a right code.",
  "A revoked or unknown key is 401 with the same body, so a 401 never says whether a key existed.",
  "Keys go in Authorization: Bearer, never in an address, form field or cookie."
 ],
